{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "label": "EventStream", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A system-wide bus for one-to-many messaging that fits neither parent-child nor sender-receiver: the publisher does not know how many subscribers exist and subscribers do not know who publishes \u2014 loose coupling for cross-cutting concerns."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventchannel", "label": "EventChannel<TEvent>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventkey", "label": "EventKey.of<T>(kind)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gives a plain kind-discriminated type the call shape a class gets for free, carries the event type into predicates, and makes the kind string checkable where a bare string quietly never matches on a typo."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_kind_channel", "label": "Kind channel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A kind channel matches exactly one kind \u2014 kinds have no base, so there is no way to say every billing.* event. A key and its string are the same channel; a class and a kind are two channels even when the class instances carry that kind, so holding both yields two deliveries per publish."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_class_channel", "label": "Class channel (instanceof matching)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subclass instances reach base-class subscribers, which is what makes hierarchical event taxonomies work \u2014 subscribers pick their level."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_predicate_filtering", "label": "Predicate filtering on the bus side", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cheaper than filtering in each subscriber for high-frequency channels. Predicate-bearing subscriptions are never deduped because predicate functions have no identity contract; a throwing predicate counts as no match; predicates run at publish time on the publisher stack."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_deadletter_event", "label": "DeadLetter event", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Publishing is all that happens to a dead letter \u2014 nothing logs or keeps it, so with no subscriber it is gone."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_dispatchererror_event", "label": "DispatcherError on the event stream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_schedulererror_event", "label": "SchedulerError on the event stream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries the cause and nothing else, because a scheduled task is an anonymous closure and a system has exactly one scheduler; the message-delivery forms do not publish here."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_cluster_membership_events", "label": "Cluster membership events", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subscribe to each concrete class directly \u2014 ClusterEvent is a union type, not a subscribable base class."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_currentclusterstate_exclusion", "label": "CurrentClusterState never reaches the bus", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It states where one subscriber is starting from, which is not news to anybody else, so it is delivered only to the listener that asked for it via replayMode snapshot."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_subscription_lifecycle", "label": "Stopped subscribers are released", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A stopping actor drops its subscriptions as part of termination, so a short-lived subscriber needs no unsubscribe in postStop. The recipient set is fixed when publish is called, so a removal takes effect from the next event on."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventchannel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventchannel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_class_channel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventchannel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_kind_channel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_kind_channel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventkey", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_predicate_filtering", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_subscription_lifecycle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_deadletter_event", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_dispatchererror_event", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_schedulererror_event", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_cluster_membership_events", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_cluster_membership_events", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_currentclusterstate_exclusion", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_schedulererror_event", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_timers_and_scheduling_schedulererror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_kind_channel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_event_stream_class_channel", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}